WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:02.267
-Welcome, everybody.

00:00:02.267 --> 00:00:04.567
Welcome, welcome, welcome,
welcome to "The Tonight Show"!

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:06.868
You're here, you made it.
You're watching at home.

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:10.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:12.267
Hey, guys,
some fun holiday news --

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:14.434
Mariah Carey just announced
that, this December,

00:00:14.434 --> 00:00:17.033
