The Rockettes were like,

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:26.434
"Stay in your lane, girl!"

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:27.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:29.100
"Stay in your lane!"

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:33.033
-Wow.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.133
-So, if you want to hear "All
I Want for Christmas is You,"

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:36.501
