but apparently, at one point,

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:41.901
Woodward asked Trump
some rapid-fire questions.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.067
Have you heard of this?
-Really?

00:01:43.067 --> 00:01:44.767
-Yeah, it's fascinating.
Take a listen to this.

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:14.300
-Yeah, just very interesting.
Rapid-fire questions.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.033
-Wow.
-Pillsbury Doughboy.

00:02:16.033 --> 00:02:18.701
-Wow!
-Guys, this is very exciting.

00:02:18.701 --> 00:02:20.667
We're only six days away
