[ Audience groans, laughs ]

00:02:40.033 --> 00:02:41.534
-Come on!

00:02:41.534 --> 00:02:43.200
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Least popular.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:46.334
The least popular costume.
-Yeah.

00:02:46.334 --> 00:02:48.767
-Yeah. Everyone
is talking about this --

00:02:48.767 --> 00:02:51.734
